      "value": "@{5a57a7d51ddd8350d922982f|full_name}: Already did so. TBH, I think VRChat should give us a way to link our Discord/Steam to our profiles so friends can connect to each other better.\n\nIf Discord can connect to steam and battle.net, there's definitely...    a way.\n\nHopefully they can find...    the way.",
