  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Other people has been talking about \"adding enter to peoples steam account through thier details page\" \nto be able to add them as friends on steam. I like that too but if that would be a thing in the future I would also like that your friends on steam would automatically be added as friends in vrc. Mabye also having a separate sub tab called \"steam friends\" so you don't need to spend 50+ hours to find each other on the servers and ending up with not being able to add them for some odd reasons.\n\nIs this impossible?",
